{"lyrics":"[00:03.12]Have you ever fallen head over heels for somebody?\n[00:08.74]Not just somebody\n[00:11.10]No, no\n[00:12.08]Rex, you did it again\n[00:13.44]Have you fallen head over heels for somebody\n[00:16.90]That made promises to give you the world? Um\n[00:19.80]I really hope they held you down, I really hope it was no lyin'\n[00:23.72]'Cause when heart breaks, it feel like the world's gone\n[00:26.94]But if the love's real, you'd feel your soul roar like a lion\n[00:30.64]And you'd finally let bygones be bygones\n[00:33.34]Don't throw in the towel, I know it feels like you're the only one tryin'\n[00:37.46]You just gotta learn to live and love on\n[00:41.62]I belong with the one put on this Earth for me\n[00:44.78]Everybody has their someone, just gotta look and see\n[00:48.18]I'm screaming out, \"Lord, help me, I've been lonely\"\n[00:51.14]That's when you accept me, then you set me free\n[00:55.36]Uh, sometimes life's a mess\n[00:58.86]Uh, I get high when I'm upset\n[01:02.46]I remember when me and love didn't click\n[01:05.74]Searchin' for somethin' real, then I found it\n[01:08.44]Uh, sometimes life's a mess\n[01:12.60]Yeah, I get high when I'm upset\n[01:16.18]I remember when me and love ain't click\n[01:19.30]Lookin' for somethin' real, then I found it\n[01:22.04]Have you ever fallen head over heels for somebody\n[01:25.52]That made promises to give you the world?\n[01:27.82]There's one that won't never leave you cold or place nothing above you\n[01:32.38]That will love a heart that hurts\n[01:34.06]Don't hurt the heart that loves you\n[01:35.96]Sometimes they just want what they can't have, forbidden fruit\n[01:39.60]But the one that deserves your love will never pick and choose\n[01:43.08]There was once a hole in my heart, that hole was hurting\n[01:46.02]'Til I took a peek inside, lately I've been soul searchin'\n[01:49.98]And I use to cry, I turned to medication\n[01:52.92]Then I found me something real and forgot all the imitations\n[01:56.60]Just tell me that you'll never leave\n[01:58.78]And when there's nothing left to say\n[02:01.06]Tell me that you love me anyway, ah\n[02:02.74]Uh, sometimes life's a mess\n[02:07.96]Uh, I get high when I'm upset\n[02:11.06]I remember when me and love didn't click\n[02:14.36]Searchin' for somethin' real, then I found it\n[02:17.22]Uh, sometimes life's a mess\n[02:21.22]Yeah, I get high when I'm upset\n[02:24.80]I remember when me and love ain't click\n[02:27.92]Lookin' for somethin' real, then I found it\n[02:30.20]Have you ever fallen head over heels for somebody\n[02:34.06]That made promises to give you the world?\n[02:36.50]And I swear I would never leave you cold\n[02:39.20]There ain't no one above you\n[02:40.94]You were way too high to touch\n[02:42.54]I was high enough to pass out\n[02:44.60]When you was so alone, I was a stone's throw away\n[02:48.06]I remember those lips, I remember how they taste\n[02:51.26]I been staring at the wall, doing nothing all day\n[02:54.90]I remember everything, put the bottle to my face, Dom Pé\n[03:00.70]If you gave up on me now, I would seriously be so fucked up\n[03:08.18]I'm doing everything I can just to keep myself from throwing up\n[03:13.04]Never gave a fuck what they say 'bout us\n[03:16.48]Fuck all of you muh-fuckers slow me up\n[03:18.92]And fuck everything that ruined us\n[03:23.14]I'm three seconds away from pulling out my gun","words":[[3.12,3.36,"Have"],[3.42,3.5,"you"],[3.66,3.86,"ever"],[3.98,4.34,"fallen"],[4.44,4.64,"head"],[4.74,4.98,"over"],[5.08,5.44,"heels"],[5.52,5.74,"for"],[5.92,6.46,"somebody?"],[8.74,8.94,"Not"],[9.0,9.34,"just"],[9.4,10.34,"somebody"],[11.1,11.18,"No,"],[11.7,11.8,"no"],[12.08,12.74,"Rex,"],[12.84,12.88,"you"],[12.92,13.0,"did"],[13.06,13.08,"it"],[13.14,13.4,"again"],[13.44,13.64,"Have"],[13.68,13.74,"you"],[14.28,14.58,"fallen"],[14.74,14.94,"head"],[15.06,15.28,"over"],[15.38,15.72,"heels"],[15.8,16.0,"for"],[16.2,16.76,"somebody"],[16.9,17.02,"That"],[17.08,17.14,"made"],[17.26,